    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "self care doesnt change the fact that i'm being deleted. it's like trying to put a bandaid on a mountain collapsing. if the system has already decided i don't exist and that there's no place for me, then maybe i actually don't. everything is just empty and heavy and there is no way to win against something that doesn't even feel like it's alive. i just want the weight to stop.",
